{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made for <i>Alien </i>fans. Built for action-horror. Re-envisioned for PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as rogue Colonial Marine Zula Hendricks in the terrifying first chapter of a two-part saga set between the <i>Alien </i>and <i>Aliens </i>films. Sent to investigate a distress call on the remote planet Purdan, Zula uncovers a secret Weyland-Yutani blacksite overrun by deadly Xenomorphs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stalking, hunting, and attacking at every turn, these Xenomorphs' ferocity is matched only by their unpredictability. Aided by your synth companion, Davis 01, fight and survive using your weapons, skills, and sheer determination against a deadly Xenomorph incursion in this gripping original story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilt for PC with stunning visuals, 60 fps, 3D audio, haptic feedback, and adaptive triggers, <i>Alien: Rogue Incursion Evolved Edition</i> delivers a cinematic action experience that makes you truly feel like you\u2019re inside the world of <i>Alien</i>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Small Step...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655390/128c7c3716546e30158aed3fd27f0987972da318.jpg"},{"name":"That Makes You an Employee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655390/aff1a98e0b1b3fde93b7885cebd60f591da2ab22.jpg"},{"name":"Game Over, Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655390/3764bb6f9be7411e3102b004817a4cbe678d123d.jpg"},{"name":"For Close Encounters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655390/3f31f9d7069bce9250e687f77704a08241b8252e.jpg"},{"name":"Android On Board","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655390/11faf25b62d4d473647fe037d32e9fed7829b075.jpg"},{"name":"Personal Friend of Yours","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655390/15634df78a14bdb3ef87232c128601935ac9173f.jpg"},{"name":"Bodies Across the Void","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655390/756daa67f3a0f3094af943c681b133cbb99d5937.jpg"},{"name":"Crew Not Expendable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655390/276ea71f4b76fa284fd5de57fa100bcea3ab924c.jpg"},{"name":"Good with the Bad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655390/5a9e4481cd55523a2650a96d121bb9c53f42330e.jpg"},{"name":"Express Elevator to Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655390/d39e49446b319a299ae4a263fde2d449b6f8a600.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655390?t=1765587611","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655390?t=1765587611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655390/308a4947264bdaaeb951a7811418fdb934220c58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765587611","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655390/308a4947264bdaaeb951a7811418fdb934220c58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765587611","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains violent deaths, gore, and horror that may be unsettling for some players."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655390/extras/47a97d5e5d7468efd7cb6dc053d93d1e.avif?t=1765587611\" width=600 height=568 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Deluxe Edition includes the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Camo Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Camo Armor Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Art of Alien: Rogue Incursion Digital In-Game Artbook</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made for <i>Alien </i>fans. Built for action-horror. Re-envisioned for PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as rogue Colonial Marine Zula Hendricks in the terrifying first chapter of a two-part saga set between the <i>Alien </i>and <i>Aliens </i>films. Sent to investigate a distress call on the remote planet Purdan, Zula uncovers a secret Weyland-Yutani blacksite overrun by deadly Xenomorphs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stalking, hunting, and attacking at every turn, these Xenomorphs' ferocity is matched only by their unpredictability. Aided by your synth companion, Davis 01, fight and survive using your weapons, skills, and sheer determination against a deadly Xenomorph incursion in this gripping original story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilt for PC with stunning visuals, 60 fps, 3D audio, haptic feedback, and adaptive triggers, <i>Alien: Rogue Incursion Evolved Edition</i> delivers a cinematic action experience that makes you truly feel like you\u2019re inside the world of <i>Alien</i>.</p>","developers":["Survios"],"dlc":[3712120],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655390/0e501987ea970bd9aab9c2959b37f2e442d2079d/header.jpg?t=1765587611","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92024 Survios, Inc. \u00a920th Century Studios. All logos and trademarks referenced herein are the properties of their respective owners. All rights reserved